# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Distribution endpoint: `curl -fsSL https://belune.dev/install.sh | bash`.
#
# Served from `main`, intentionally NOT a per-version tag: install.sh resolves
# the latest release itself at runtime (GitHub releases/latest) and fetches the
# image + config from that release tag, so the served copy never needs to name a
# version. Pinning this to a tag would just freeze the installer and force an
# edit every release. Target is set once and left alone.
/install.sh  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/belune-hq/belune/main/scripts/install.sh  302

